{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0182hKopPGkABuWxdTs58Ato","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tversion: 1\n2\tlast_updated: '2026-05-25'\n3\t# Wave L1 (2026-06-07): Message Batches API discount multiplier applied to\n4\t# usd_estimate when CostRecorder.record(... batch_mode=True). 0.5 ≈ Anthropic's\n5\t# ~50% batch discount. ESTIMATE — flagged verified:false in `verification:`.\n6\tbatch_discount: 0.5\n7\tvendors:\n8\t  anthropic:\n9\t    claude-sonnet-4-6:\n10\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 3.0\n11\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 15.0\n12\t      # Wave L1 (2026-06-07): prompt-caching sub-rates. cache_read ~0.1x input,\n13\t      # cache_write ~1.25x input (5-min ephemeral TTL). ESTIMATE — flagged\n14\t      # verified:false in the verification block below.\n15\t      cache_read_per_million_usd: 0.3\n16\t      cache_write_per_million_usd: 3.75\n17\t    claude-haiku-4-5-20251001:\n18\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 1.0\n19\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 5.0\n20\t      cache_read_per_million_usd: 0.1\n21\t      cache_write_per_million_usd: 1.25\n22\t    claude-opus-4-6:\n23\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 5.0\n24\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 25.0\n25\t    # Wave L5 (2026-06-07): CURRENT Opus tier. claude-opus-4-8 is the live Opus\n26\t    # ($5/$25 in/out), cross-checked against the bundled claude-api skill\n27\t    # (platform.claude.com pricing, cached 2026-05-26: Opus 4.8 $5/$25) — so the\n28\t    # verification entry below is verified:true. Cache sub-rates mirror the L1\n29\t    # structure (cache_read ~0.1x input = 0.5, cache_write ~1.25x input = 6.25;\n30\t    # 4096-token cache minimum per the skill). The 4.7+ tokenizer counts ~35%\n31\t    # more tokens than 4.6 (claude-api skill: \"Updated token counting\"); that\n32\t    # caveat is carried by `tokenizer_factor` (1.35), which is consumed ONLY by\n33\t    # the pre-call ESTIMATE helper in llm.py — NEVER by post-call metering, which\n34\t    # always uses the real resp.usage counts (ground truth). claude-opus-4-6 is\n35\t    # kept above (still a live, priced, active tier).\n36\t    claude-opus-4-8:\n37\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 5.0\n38\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 25.0\n39\t      cache_read_per_million_usd: 0.5\n40\t      cache_write_per_million_usd: 6.25\n41\t      tokenizer_factor: 1.35\n42\t  gemini:\n43\t    # Wave 4 (2026-06-06): per-rate verification status lives in the top-level\n44\t    # `verification:` block below (machine-readable; the cost rollup can flag\n45\t    # estimate-priced spend). gemini-3.5-flash and gemini-embedding-2 remain\n46\t    # ESTIMATES — no published Google SKU to pin them to — so they are flagged\n47\t    # verified:false there. The unmetered MCP query-embedding path the\n48\t    # cost-audit suspected is now closed (server.py:_embed_query meters into\n49\t    # costs). gemini-2.5-pro/flash are real published Google rates;\n50\t    # text-embedding-004 is a best-effort estimate (flagged verified:false too).\n51\t    # See reports/cost-audit-2026-06-05.md.\n52\t    gemini-3.5-flash:\n53\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 1.5\n54\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 9.0\n55\t    gemini-embedding-2:        # priced for the bare key AND `models/gemini-embedding-2` (lookup strips the prefix)\n56\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 0.2\n57\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 0.0\n58\t    text-embedding-004:        # legacy embedder default in llm.call_gemini_embedding\n59\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 0.2\n60\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 0.0\n61\t    gemini-2.5-pro:\n62\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 1.25\n63\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 10.0\n64\t    gemini-2.5-flash:\n65\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 0.3\n66\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 2.5\n67\t  deepseek:\n68\t    deepseek-chat:\n69\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 0.27\n70\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 1.10\n71\t  groq:\n72\t    llama-3.3-70b-versatile:\n73\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 0.59\n74\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 0.79\n75\t  local:\n76\t    default:\n77\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 0.0\n78\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 0.0\n79\tdefault_models:\n80\t  scout:\n81\t    vendor: gemini\n82\t    model: gemini-3.5-flash\n83\t  runner:\n84\t    vendor: anthropic\n85\t    model: claude-sonnet-4-6\n86\t  critic_a:\n87\t    vendor: anthropic\n88\t    model: claude-sonnet-4-6\n89\t  critic_b:\n90\t    vendor: gemini\n91\t    model: gemini-3.5-flash\n92\t  reconciler:\n93\t    vendor: anthropic\n94\t    model: claude-sonnet-4-6\n95\t  embedder:\n96\t    vendor: gemini\n97\t    model: gemini-3.5-flash\n98\t  librarian:\n99\t    vendor: gemini\n100\t    model: gemini-3.5-flash"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ACwxJodXAE6No2Hnb7B6TY","session_id":"a7fcfbf6-6e6f-495e-9c53-2f0602be6ffe","uuid":"997ce333-ee50-44a0-8097-cf5e86953862","timestamp":"2026-06-23T19:01:47.247Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Map Aurora architecture & code"}
