{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Eoh4S9wXDYSU3HJUWdVtrE","type":"tool_result","content":"2:embeddings) and per-artifact markdown into library/<sweep_or_kind>/<slug>/index.md.\n3:Also regenerates the top-level library/index.md.\n542:            # Best-effort scrub: remove stale library/<kind>/<slug>/index.md\n547:                         / candidate.proposed_slug / \"index.md\")\n634:    \"\"\"Write library/<kind>/<slug>/index.md.\n645:    out = folder / \"index.md\"\n708:        f\"**Last verified:** {_now()}\",\n737:    \"\"\"Write library/index.md with a domain×complexity grid view.\n792:        link = f\"[{name}]({kind}s/{slug}/index.md)\"\n806:    out = library_root / \"index.md\"\n978:    \"\"\"Write library/models/<provider>/<family>-<version>/index.md with a\n986:    out = folder / \"index.md\"\n999:        f\"**Last verified:** {model_row.get('last_metadata_verified_at') or _now()}\",\n1226:        md_path = f\"models/{r['provider']}/{fam_ver}/index.md\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y16vzRsaFa4WCzXfR89u1q","session_id":"a7fcfbf6-6e6f-495e-9c53-2f0602be6ffe","uuid":"d196e515-56f2-4785-b86d-b872f9da3e90","timestamp":"2026-06-23T19:02:27.660Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Audit Aurora recent work & health"}
