C-BY ingester + OpenRouter enrich (optional) | +12 tests, CC1 scrub verified |\n| **W4** | Momentum + value/health | `morning_briefing.py::_momentum_block` + `_value_health_block` + `/api/health/summary` endpoint | +16 tests, plain-English RAG |\n| **W5** | Decisions table + labels | `kb/migrations/0028_decisions.sql` + `/api/decisions/record` + `_decisions_block` card renderer | +17 tests, CC1 scrub |\n\n**Key Features Wired In:**\n- \"What-moved momentum\" (MOMENTUM_TOP_N=5, MOMENTUM_FADE_NIGHTS=3) displayed in briefing and dashboard\n- \"Plain-English value/health\" (4-question RAG: working? worth it? what's wrong? what to think about?) → JSON-free plaintext\n- \"Decisions + labels\" (adoption tracking, 👍/👎 capture via `/api/decisions/record`)\n- \"Benchmark thin-slice\" (Epoch CC-BY + Apache-2.0 sources, sparse composite coverage k/5 shown)\n- \"Decision-grade model view\" (/api/catalog/models/best, per-model cards with provenance badges)\n\n**Integration Points:**\n- `morning_briefing.py::build_session_note()` renders \"Models — N tracked\" headline + weekly model-delta block\n- `dashboard/web/blueprint.py::catalog_models_best()` returns decision cards with confidence caps\n- `reports/morning/latest_summary.json` embeds all models/momentum/health data (see structure below)\n\n**Latest Summary Structure** (`reports/morning/latest_summary.json` 2026-06-23):\n```json\n{\n  \"date\": \"2026-06-23\",\n  \"productivity_index\": 0.238,\n  \"models\": {\"total\": 326, \"license_distribution\": [...], \"benchmarks\": null},\n  \"momentum\": {\n    \"window_nights\": 3,\n    \"total_new\": 5,\n    \"categories\": [\n      {\"kind\": \"tool\", \"new_total\": 3, \"items\": [...]},\n      {\"kind\": \"agent\", \"new_total\": 2, \"items\": [...]}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"value_health\": {\n    \"rag\": \"amber\",\n    \"rag_reason\": \"value signals are open-loop — too few logged decisions (n<30)\",\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"useful_find_rate\": {\"status\": \"open_loop\", \"samp