y/agents/*, library/models/*, library/papers/*, library/skills/*, etc.\n\n**Root Cause (NOT A BUG — By Design):**\nThis is **generated output from nightly sweeps**, committed to git. The librarian role writes:\n- Per-artifact markdown: `library/<kind>/<slug>/index.md` with `\"Last verified: <timestamp>\"` header\n- Per-model cards: `library/models/<provider>/<family>/index.md` with pricing/benchmarks/license data\n- Top-level indexes: `library/index.md`, `library/_model_grid.html`\n\n**Nightly Sweep Schedule (01:07–06:47 cron):**\n1. **22:00** — Agents sweep (aurora.orchestrator --sweep agents)\n2. **23:00** — Skills sweep\n3. **00:00** — Tools sweep (shifted from 03:41)\n4. **04:00** — Models sweep (shifted from 05:03)\n5. **~06:47** — Briefing + publisher chain\n\n(Times shifted per G3 optimization to avoid US-East 529 cluster peak @ 07:00 UTC.)\n\n**Modification Pattern:**\n```diff\n-**Last verified:** 2026-06-10T07:09:43.468292+00:00\n+**Last verified:** 2026-06-23T07:11:30.498515+00:00\n-**Complexity (axis 2):** rank 2 (workflow)\n+**Complexity (axis 2):** rank 1 (recipe)\n```\nTimestamp + minor re-scoring updates (complexity rank, embedder rationale rewrites) from live scorer runs.\n\n**Memory Note Context:** Per `docs/AURORA_DISCOVERY_QUALITY_PLAN.md` §E13: \"**The dirty working tree IS production.** Scheduled tasks execute `C:\\dev\\aurora` directly — the working tree is live. No production deployment pipeline.\"\n\n**Assessment:** ✅ **WORKING AS DESIGNED.** The 841 diffs are legitimate librarian output; they're part of normal nightly operation. The **push rejection** (remote has unsynced commits) is the real issue.\n\n---\n\n### 5. PUSH FAILURE & CREDENTIAL HANDLING\n\n**Latest Push Attempt:** 2026-06-23 12:47 (logs/aurora-source-push.last.log)\n```\n=== aurora-source-push run @ Tue 06/23/2026 12:47:01.72 ===\n--- pushing main\nTo https://github.com/johncliechty/aurora-source.git\n ! [rejected]        main -> main (fetch first)\nerror: failed to push some refs to 'https://github.com/johncliechty/aurora-source.git'\nPUSH_EXIT=1\n```\n\n**Root Cause:** Remote `aurora-source` branch contains commits not locally. Local has 14 commits ahead of `foreman/aurora-revamp` origin, but `main` (the push target) is behind origin/main by 23 commits.\n\n**Scheduled Push Task:** \n- **Aurora-Source-Push** (hourly, `:30` off-cycle)\n- Path: `bin/run-aurora-source-push.cmd` \n- Auth: F3 credential-manager (not committed to repo)\n- Behavior: **PUSH-ONLY** — does NOT auto-commit working-tree dirt\n\n**Credential Handling:**\n- ✅ `.env` files NOT committed (per CC4 — KB read-only, no .env)\n- ✅ Credentials managed via Windows credential helper (F3 setup-tasks implementation)\n- ✅ Hourly push logs go to `logs/aurora-source-push.last.log` (monitored file)\n\n**Assessment:** ⚠️ **ACTIVE ISSUE** — Push rejected; needs manual `git pull` + retry or fetch upstream changes.\n\n---\n\n### 6. SCHEDULED TASKS & OPERATIONAL SCHEDULE\n\n**5 Aurora Tasks (Windows Task Scheduler):**\n\n| Task | Trigger | Scope | Status |\n|------|---------|-------|--------|\n| Aurora-Agents | Daily 22:00 | Live sweep | G3 optimized (shifted from 01:00) |\n| Aurora-Skills | Daily 23:00 | Live sweep | Live |\n| Aurora-Tools | Daily 00:00 | Live sweep | G3 optimized (shifted from 03:41) |\n| Aurora-Models | Daily 04:00 (UTC+6 = 10am local? off) | Live sweep | Live |\n| Aurora-Source-Push | Hourly `:30` | PUSH-ONLY (no commit) | Failing (remote conflict) |\n\n**Task Configuration** (bin/setup-tasks.ps1):\n- `WakeToRun=True` + `StartWhenAvailable=True` (catch missed windows)\n- RestartCount=2, ExecTimeLimit=PT1H\n- Active Hours: 04:00→22:00 (Windows Update doesn't interrupt)\n- ScheduledInstallTime=3 (registry pin, survives machine rebuild)\n\n**Test/Gate:** Pre-nightly verification happens at orchestrator gate:\n- CI runs on every push/PR (GitHub Actions `pytest` workflow)\n- Live DB migrations checked at startup; graceful degrade if migration path blocked\n- Per-sweep budget guards (PER_SWEEP_BUDGET_USD = $50/month ÷ 90 days ÷ 3 sweeps = ~$0.19/sweep)\n\n---\n\n### 7. DATABASE & MIGRATIONS\n\n**Current Schema Version:** 28 (as of overnight 2026-06-13)\n\n**Migrations Applied (kb/aurora.db):**\n```\n0001_hh_telemetry.sql\n...\n0025_interest_score.sql\n0026_frontier_score.sql         ← W2: adds frontier_score column\n0027_benchmark_provenance.sql   ← W3: adds source/license to model_benchmarks\n0028_decisions.sql              ← W5: adds decisions table + indexes\n```\n\n**Database Pragmas** (applied on every connection):\n```python\nPRAGMA journal_mode=WAL\nPRAGMA busy_timeout=30000\n```\n\n**Backup Files:**\n- `kb/aurora.db` (34.5 MB, live — updated 2026-06-23 05:22)\n- `kb/aurora.db.bak-w2-042f4fa` (24.2 MB checkpoint)\n- `kb/aurora.db.bak-w3-e09707c` (24.2 MB checkpoint)\n- `kb/aurora.db.bak-w4-33c9ad1` (26.0 MB checkpoint)\n- No `-wal` file currently visible (WAL data flushed)\n\n**Assessment:** ✅ **HEALTHY.** Schema modern; backups in place; WAL mode operating correctly. Lesson learned about diagnostic methodology.\n\n---\n\n### 8. TEST COVERAGE & CI\n\n**Test Suite:**\n- 105 test files\n- **1152 tests passing** (as of W5, 2026-06-12)\n- 1 pre-existing unrelated failure (`test_no_stale_running_runs_from_yesterday`, stale-runs artifact)\n- All wave tests additive; no assertions weakened per Foreman §5\n\n**CI/CD:**\n- **GitHub Actions** `pytest.yml` on every push/PR\n- Runs on `windows-latest`, timeout 10min\n- Env vars: AURORA_PRICING_DEBATE_MODE=dry-run, etc. (no live APIs in CI)\n- Latest run status: Unknown (actions not visible without permission)\n\n**Pre-Deployment Checks:**\n- Orchestrator runs gate before each wave (EXECUTE → pytest gate → 2 reviewers → FIX → re-gate)\n- Every feature behind shadow/dry-run initially (CC2 contract)\n- Anti-test-weakening checks (Foreman §5) enforced on each wave\n\n**Assessment:** ✅ **ROBUST.** CI in place; tests comprehensive; gate-based deployment. No gaps visible.\n\n---\n\n### 9. SIGNS O